@startuml
title Order pricing — conceptual domain, baseline 1
left to right direction
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
hide methods
hide empty members

class Cart
class CartLine
class Product
class Coupon
class PriceQuote

Cart -- CartLine : lines
CartLine -- Product : product
PriceQuote -- Cart : quoted cart
PriceQuote -- Coupon : applied coupon

note bottom of Cart
  A nonempty Cart is quotable.
  Each CartLine names one Product and a quantity.
  Cardinalities and values are specified in glossary.md.
end note
note bottom of Product
  Product price comes from a trusted catalog snapshot.
  A client price is never authoritative.
end note
note bottom of PriceQuote
  A PriceQuote is a read-only result, not an Order.
  An absent Coupon means zero discount.
end note
@enduml
